<title>USA: Applied Materials sues Varian.</title>
<headline>Applied Materials sues Varian.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Materials Inc has sued Varian Associates Inc claiming infringement of four patents.</p>
<p>The suit, filed in the United States District Court for the Northern District of California, alleges Varian's M2i, MB(2) and Inova Physical Vapor Deposition systems violate the Applied Materials patents, Applied Materials said in a statement issued late Friday.</p>
<p>Applied Materials said the two companies had been in discussions over several of the patents during the past year.</p>
<p>Varian officials could not be reached for comment.</p>
</text>
